OL,3,GNEWSA'Headguard makes me feel confident
OL,4,Aand unique'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Olivia Garcia scored her first
OL,7,Fgoal in the Women's Super League for
OL,8,FBrighton, you would be forgiven for
OL,9,Fthinking she had recently come back
OL,10,Ffrom a head injury.
OL,12,FThe statement headguard the forward
OL,13,Fwears, which she likened to former
OL,14,FChelsea goalkeeper Petr Cech's, means
OL,15,Fshe is easy to pick out on the pitch.
OL,17,FBut it is as much about respect for her
OL,18,Ffather, after a childhood playing
OL,19,F"soccer" in Nevada, as it is about
OL,20,Fsafety.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
