OL,3,GNEWSA'Headguard makes me feel confident
OL,4,Aand unique'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I started playing with boys back home
OL,7,Fand around eight or nine years old,
OL,8,Fboys get faster and stronger," she
OL,9,Fexplained. "My dad ` who is very
OL,10,Fprotective of his daughter ` said 'if
OL,11,Fyou want to continue playing with boys
OL,12,Fyou have to wear this.'"
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
